Z||000005||KissMySSFiero||08-14-2001||01:38 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by MinnGreenGT:<BR><B>I've been scoping the Cadillac Catera since I rented a VauxHall Omega <P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>stay away from the cateras.  they are the biggest POS since the Cadi Cimeron.  way underpowered and overpriced, plus the harmonic balancer falls off.  then BOOM  new engine time.  i worked in the service dept at a cadi dealer 2 yrs ago and put a half a dozen of them in in about 8 months.  if you get a cadi at least get the Nstar.  Now thats a good engine.  <BR><P>------------------<BR>JOEJOE Aol:SSFiero <P>88FORMULA<BR>      <A HREF="mailto:SSFiero@Aol.com">SSFiero@Aol.com</A>       <P>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FORUMSIG1.jpg">           <BR>"Kids in the backseat cause accidents,  accidents in the backseat caused me!!"||||reg||1
